  "Each scenario runs its steps in order on ONE guard. defaults.topstep is merged (shallow) under scenario.topstep; account_name feeds the auto phase/preset.",
  "step.closed lists the trades that closed since the previous step: the runner accumulates them, balance = start + all nets, dayRealized and the closed results",
  "are the ones closed since the session start. step.unrealized is the open P&L at that moment. expect.codes are the reason codes in order;",
  "expect.metrics is a subset compared to the cent. Expected values are worked out by hand from the Topstep rules, see each name.",
